WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.301
What to carry forward.

2
00:00:01.581 --> 00:00:08.536
The labs’ frameworks share an if-then structure and a self-governance weakness; read the current version and who verifies it.

3
00:00:08.816 --> 00:00:17.584
Interpretability can see some real mechanisms but not most of the computation, and a model’s stated reasoning is evidence, not a record.

4
00:00:17.864 --> 00:00:35.421
Reward hacking, sycophancy, and agentic misbehavior are documented in primary sources and have direct analogues in your agents and evals: protect your graders, read your passes, keep monitoring on during experiments, and never let one model be the only check on itself.

5
00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:40.203
Next lesson: what governments now require, and what that means for an engineer.
